{"id":3451,"date":"2020-12-02T16:49:10","date_gmt":"2020-12-02T16:49:10","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/?page_id=3451"},"modified":"2021-11-24T15:29:52","modified_gmt":"2021-11-24T15:29:52","slug":"venue-and-useful-information","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/workshops\/leiden2022\/venue-and-useful-information\/","title":{"rendered":"Venue and Useful information"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2>Your safety is our priority<\/h2>\n<p>Help us make\u00a0SWAT4HCLS a safe and welcoming event. We are closely following government regulations for conferences. As such, we ask you to keep in mind:<\/p>\n<p>A <span class=\"highlight\">Covid<\/span> vaccination certificate, proof of negative test or proof of recovery in the last 6 months are mandatory. We will require scannable QR codes and a valid ID at the registration desk. Ticket sales have been capped at 75% capacity of the venue. Masks are advised but not mandatory.<\/p>\n<h2>Getting there<\/h2>\n<p>Leiden is situated just a stone&#8217;s throw from major cities like The Hague and Amsterdam.<\/p>\n<h3>Train and bus connections<\/h3>\n<p>Leiden is easy to reach by public transport. The city centre is a few steps from <a href=\"http:\/\/www.ns.nl\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Leiden Central station<\/a>. The Hague is ten minutes away by train, and Amsterdam thirty-five minutes.<br \/>\nThe bus station is right in front of Leiden Central station and there are many <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arriva.nl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">routes serving the city and the region<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>Public transportation information is integrated into Google Maps. You can also download the NS (Nederlandse Spoorwegen) app for your mobile for detailed information about trains and\u00a0 train stations.<\/p>\n<h3>Airports<\/h3>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.schiphol.nl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Schiphol Airport<\/a> (IATA: AMS) is less than twenty minutes away.<\/p>\n<h2>Venue<\/h2>\n<p>SWAT4HCLS 2022 will be held in Leiden, The Netherlands and online. For participants who can join us in person, the venue will be the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wellnesshotelleiden.nl\/en\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Fletcher Wellness-Hotel<\/a> Leiden, shown below on the left side of the\u00a0LUMC (Leiden University Medical Center).<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-3483 size-large\" src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/LUMC-4mp-1024x682.jpg\" alt=\"LUMC\" width=\"620\" height=\"413\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/LUMC-4mp-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/LUMC-4mp-300x200.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 620px) 100vw, 620px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>The Hotel\u00a0is located behind Leiden\u2019s Central Station and is within walking distance.<\/p>\n<h2>About Leiden<\/h2>\n<p>A university city since 1575, Leiden has been one of Europe&#8217;s most prominent scientific centres for more than four centuries. University buildings are scattered throughout the city and the many students from all over the world give the city a bustling, vivid and international atmosphere. Leiden offers many\u00a0historical attractions and\u00a0great spots to visit.\u00a0Canals, city gates, bridges and mills, courtyard gardens make up the city center.<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-3486 size-large\" src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/Stadstimmerwerf-Galgewater-Molen-De-Put-1024x736.jpg\" alt=\"Leiden canals\" width=\"620\" height=\"446\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/Stadstimmerwerf-Galgewater-Molen-De-Put-1024x736.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/Stadstimmerwerf-Galgewater-Molen-De-Put-300x216.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 620px) 100vw, 620px\" \/><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/Jean-Pesijnhofje.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-3487\" src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/Jean-Pesijnhofje-1024x645.jpg\" alt=\"Leiden courtyards\" width=\"620\" height=\"391\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/Jean-Pesijnhofje-1024x645.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/Jean-Pesijnhofje-300x189.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 620px) 100vw, 620px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Many museums, the most notable is the Hortus Botanicus (botanical garden), a taxonomer&#8217;s paradise.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/Hortus-botanicus-tuin.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-3488 size-large\" src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/Hortus-botanicus-tuin-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"Hortus botanicus Leiden \" width=\"620\" height=\"414\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/Hortus-botanicus-tuin-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/Hortus-botanicus-tuin-300x200.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 620px) 100vw, 620px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Your safety is our priority Help us make\u00a0SWAT4HCLS a safe and welcoming event. We are closely following government regulations for conferences. As such, we ask you to keep in mind: A Covid vaccination certificate, proof of negative test or proof &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/workshops\/leiden2022\/venue-and-useful-information\/\">Continue reading <span class=\"meta-nav\">&rarr;<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":3529,"parent":3430,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-3451","page","type-page","status-publish","